From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryson <10244083+brysonwf@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:06:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: configs: duo.config: intent only

The fragment had grown to 722 lines (an old sweep that spelled out values make defconfig already gives, plus
options that other options select). Reduced to the 433 lines the Duo build needs: every removal was checked by
regenerating the configuration - make defconfig duo.config produces a byte-identical .config, so the kernel does not
change.

This patch was written by Claude (Anthropic's AI assistant) under the direction of Bryson, who reviewed and
tested it on a Surface Duo.

Signed-off-by: Bryson <10244083+brysonwf@users.noreply.github.com>
---
